window.products.push({"id":958391,"name":"Louriel Foldable Pasta Drying Rack - Durable Food Safe ABS Plastic Noodle Dry Stand with Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Stem and 10 Arms for Large Batch P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MqHBiGk3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Louriel Foldable Pasta Drying Rack with Dough Cutter Delicious Italian Dishes Create authentic Italian dishes in your own kitchen! Use the Louriel Pasta Drying Rack to make a variety of pasta like spaghetti, linguine, tagliatelle, lasagna, and fettuccine to impress friends and family. Gone are the days that your pasta sticks to each other, to counters, or to your tea towel. The stand was designed to make life simpler by keeping your freshly made pasta separate. Phenomenal Quality The Collapsible Pasta Drying Rack is made from Food Safe ABS material with a stainless steel stem. The holder has 10 Hanging Arms and each arm can carry a total of 1 lb (0.45 kg) of freshly made noodles. This makes it easy to prepare pasta in bulk for those big dinner parties. Practical and Easy to Use It could not be easier to use the noodle stand, just follow these simple steps: (No screws or tools needed) 1. Lift the pasta drying arm up to 90 degrees and insert the arm into the slot. 2. Pull down the legs and insert into the slot position. 3. After using the rack, simply wipe the rods with a damp cloth or rinse it in warm soapy water and let it dry. 4. The drying rack folds up flat after use for quick and effortless storage, saving space on counters. The folded size is 8.6 inches in height and 3.5 inches in width. More Value We have created an all-in-one package for your convenience! Use the multipurpose Dough Cutter to slice pasta dough balls into various shapes and sizes. The sharp, angled blade will make dividing dough into smaller pieces a breeze. The cutter is made from heavy-duty plastic that is dishwasher safe for a quick and effortless clean. What's Included? - 1 x Louriel Pasta Drying Rack- 1 x Dough Cutter (3.2 x 5.2 inch)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MqHBiGk3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Louriel","source_asin":"B08PP9MYRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PP9MYRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PP9MYRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
