window.products.push({"id":958526,"name":"Mindful Design Cooling Memory Foam Knee Pillow for Side Sleepers - Contoured Leg Wedge Pillow with Removable Cover, Ideal for Hip, Back and Joint Pain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VeYuif+ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wake up refreshed and pain free with the Mindful Design Memory Foam Knee Pillow with Cooling Gel! Designed to cushion and support the knees, this firm leg pillow provides the ideal amount of support for side sleepers, promoting natural and healthier sleeping habits. The high density memory foam core contours to your body as you relax, ergonomically supporting the areas you need it most, while helping bring the spine and hips back into proper alignment. A panel of soothing cooling gel provides unmatched cooling relief, helping to dissipate body heat so you sleep better. And, if you need to clean the air knit cover for any reason, the discreet zipper on the top allows the pillowcase to come off for easy spot cleaning. Perfect for pregnant women, side sleepers, or hip and joint pain sufferers, the Mindful Design Semi Knee Pillow will soothe your aches and pains, to let you achieve deep, restful sleep. Measures 10.5\" L x 7.6\" W x 7\" H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VeYuif+ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mindful Design","source_asin":"B07BLH9TH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BLH9TH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BLH9TH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":958527,"name":"INSE Corded Vacuum Cleaner, Corded Stick Vacuum 600W Powerful Motor Corded Vacuum Cleaner, 18000Pa Stick Vacuum Cleaner - Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1p7hCP5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POWERFUL MOTOR - This INSE vacuum cleaner is equipped with a 600W strong motor which is stronger than most vacuum cleaners of its size, can generate up to 18000Pa powerful suction, perfect for hardwood floors, marble floors, tile, low pile carpet and can easily pick up all kinds of particles like dust, pet hair, pet litter, cereal, etc. A strong motor ensures decent suction, please don't worry motor part's temperature is higher than other parts. VERSATILE - The corded stick vacuum is easy to assemble and it has 3 different attachment heads - main floor brush & crevice tool & 2-in-1 brush. There is a button on the main floor brush, you can switch it when cleaning different surfaces such as hard floors or carpeted floors. When convert from a stick vacuum cleaner to a handheld vacuum cleaner, it performs decently on corners, stairs, shelves, and even on your car. HIGH-EFFICIENCY - The corded vacuum cleaner consists of a filtration system with durable high-efficiency filter pad, capable of capturing all of the microscopic dust. The filter pad protects the motor to ensure the vacuum cleaner works decently and helps to keep a clean and healthy home for you and your family. The white filter is pre-installed in the dust cup, please make sure to use the vacuum cleaner with the filter. PERFECT LENGTH - I5 corded stick vacuum cleaner allows up to 23ft long distance cleaning and most importantly you don't need to worry about running out of power. And the adjustable tube can be easily adjusted from 19 to 31 inches, the lightweight vacuum cleaner is very suitable for all family members to use. EASY TO USE - This vacuum is easy to operate. One click can start the vacuum, no need to keep pressing the switch. And one press can empty the 1L dust cup without making your hand dirty. The filter is washable and reusable, please leave it dry before using it. The key to maximum performance is having clean filters. Cleaning the filters will help your vacuum operate at peak efficiency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1p7hCP5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0C89M1WCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C89M1WCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C89M1WCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
