window.products.push({"id":958531,"name":"MyGift Clear Acrylic Nail Polish Organizer Rack, 6-Tier 36-Bottle Display Stand with Filer & Brush Cup Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9171ZfriJ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organize and show off your makeup, nail polish, and other items for home use or for sale with this stylish display stand. This modern, and durable clear acrylic organizer is ideal for adding a touch of sleek, professional style to your store displays or your home storage, and it's easy to clean if spills or splashes fall on the acrylic material. Each of the 6 stair-step style tiers comes with a clear acrylic railing that you keep your items beautifully displayed and perfectly in place. Meanwhile, the right-hand end of this tiered display organizer features a open-top acrylic box that allows you to keep pens, makeup brushes, and other items conveniently close at hand. Simply set this acrylic organizer on any counter, shelf, or table to bring organization and style to any space. **Official MyGift product includes multipurpose cleaning towel.** Nail polish bottles not included. Approximate Dimensions: 8.7\" W X 12.2\" D X 12.2\" H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9171ZfriJ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyGift","source_asin":"B00LVBLE8E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LVBLE8E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LVBLE8E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":958532,"name":"NIKKY HOME Bear Clock Double Sided Wall Clock Cabin Home Decor Rustic Forest Farmhouse Vintage Metal Cute Hanging Large Clock Nature Animal Decorative","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TpiIQOWXS._AC_SL1195_.jpg","description":"🐻【ABSOLUTELY HIGH-QUALITY 】- This bear clock is made of high-quality durable metal. and painted handmade by skilled craftsman with antique forest style, complex craftsmanship, structure, and various precision functions, making your clock more unique. It won’t break down over time. 🐻【DOUBLE FACED CLOCK】- Metal wall clock 14.37 x 4.13 x 22.83 inches. Dial Size: 9”.Two-sided clock allows you to read time information easily at any angle. A large dial scale and a wide 9-inch diameter make the time easy to read from up close and far away. No seconds hand, more silent. 🐻【VINTAGE FOREST STYLE】- Inspired by the story of a hunter and the bear, the two-sided clock is not only a functional wall clock but also an exquisite artwork. Classic round shape, brown coating, and antique parchment-color face make an affordable gift choice for your friends or family. No animal lover on the earth will refuse such a funny and cute present. 🐻【 EASY TO MOUNT】- Battery powered, requires 2 AA zinc-carbon batteries (not included) only. Simply mount it to your preferred wall or fence using the sturdy built-in mount (screws are included), then hang the clock on the bottom of the bracket. it is ideal for cabin decor, lobby, patio, garden, fence, lanai, farmhouse, yard, porch, or corridor. 🐻【GUARANTEED】- Nikky Home is committed to the highest levels of quality and excellent service. If you have any problem with the product or service, please contact us without hesitation, we are always here to assist the valued customer for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TpiIQOWXS._AC_SL1195_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NIKKY HOME","source_asin":"B07C3LPNC1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C3LPNC1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C3LPNC1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":958533,"name":"C.R. Gibson Porcelain Plates in a Decorative Box, Light Bite, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A8LVm6xBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nothing says home quite like the kitchen. The story of our lives is lived there and as the recognized leader in recipe storage products, C.R. Gibson offers a stylish way to record and organize the heart of these moments with matching accessories that brighten up the whole kitchen. You can trust C.R. Gibson, synonymous with quality for more than 140 years. Starting with the creation of the very first baby book in 1898, families around the world have depended on C.R. Gibson as their number one provider of products that celebrate life's most cherished moments. Today you'll not only find baby books and photo albums, you'll also find a wide choice of party supplies, gift ideas and little luxuries to make your life easier and more colorful. Understanding the importance of design and craftsmanship, all C.R. Gibson products offer a tradition of quality in products that highlight classic styling as well as today's top fashions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A8LVm6xBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.R. Gibson","source_asin":"B00C4NVTS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C4NVTS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C4NVTS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":958534,"name":"Emile Henry Couleurs 4-Piece Red Place Setting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5121SA90Y3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com The four pieces in this set, a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl, and mug, brighten any contemporary dining table. They can go directly from freezer to oven, into the microwave, through the dishwasher, and under the broiler without harming their glossy, lead-free glaze, which does not absorb odors or moisture and is so hard it will not crack, craze, discolor, or scratch--even when food is cut directly on it. The set complements other Emile Henry Couleurs tableware. Since 1850, Emile Henry cookware and bakeware have been made in Burgundy, where a unique clay is kiln-fired into a ceramic unsurpassed for conducting and retaining heat. Prized worldwide, Emile Henry products come in a wide range of colors, from the translucent, traditional earthtones (with creamy interiors) of the rustic Le Potier line to the bright, modern hues of the Couleurs line (with white interiors), of which this set is a gleaming example. Each piece is stamped with the year it was made and the initials of the craftsman who attested to its perfection and carries a one-year warranty against defects. --Fred Brack Whats in the Box 1 place setting. Place setting consists of: 11-inch dinner plate; 8-inch salad/dessert plate; 9-inch soup bowl; 12.8-ounce mug. 4 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5121SA90Y3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B0000645RJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000645RJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000645RJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
