window.products.push({"id":958752,"name":"Cuisinart Reversible Print Oven Mitts, 2pk - Heat Resistant Oven Gloves Provide Protection and Safe Insulation to Handle Hot Kitchen Items - Non Slip ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O69YvZHcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Imagine the aroma in your home from delicious lasagna baking in the oven. The oven timer beeps and the cheese is starting to bubble, turning a golden brown. It’s ready. Take all the stress of removing the hot dish from the scorching oven with these Cuisinart Oven Mitts.Everyday kitchen essentials with a sophisticated design, this oven mitts set is available in multiple colors with a reversible print design and aesthetically pleasing patterns on each side. The reversible mitts that can be worn on either hand, to help protect you against burns from inadvertently touching a hot surface. Each Cuisinart oven mitt measures 7 x 11.5 inches. Designed to suit many décor styles, store them away discretely in a drawer or hang them on kitchen hooks using the handy snap button closure tab for added vintage kitchen decor.Must have kitchen set with premium fabric material that provides protection and safe insulation without sacrificing comfort.This 2 pack long Oven Mitts are ideal for holding hot and warm dishes, a cast iron skillet, cookie trays, plates, bowls and more. This oven mitt set allows you to grip kitchen items and utensils of different sizes to protect your hands from extreme temperatures.The Cuisinart Oven Mittens are comfortable, durable and easy care – hand wash and lay flat to dry. They make a great Christmas or thanksgiving gift for the men and women in your life that enjoy cooking and baking at home.Cuisinart – savor the good life. Cuisinart luxury performance kitchen textiles offer a new level of quality, durability and style. Our products are built for comfort and long-lasting performance. Enjoy! The colors you see on screen may not be a totally accurate reproduction of the product. We strive to make our colors as accurate as possible, but screen images are intended as a guide only and should not be regarded as absolutely correct.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O69YvZHcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B08BJB6NXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BJB6NXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BJB6NXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
