window.products.push({"id":958757,"name":"SGI Breathable Bamboo Bed Sheets Set - Genuine 100% Organic Bamboo Sheets - Aqua Blue Queen Size 4PC's Sheet Set - Bamboo Sheet & Pillowcase Sets Fit ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OXKclQ+lL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"✔ GENUINE 100% ORGANIC BAMBOO SHEETS - Crafted from the finest 100% Organic Bamboo, Pure Bamboo luxury bed sheets are OEKO-TEX Standard 100 Certified and have been tested for over 100 harmful substances, ensuring that it is safe, healthy and environmentally friendly for your family. Pure Bamboo bed sheets are never blended with other fibers or fabrics. BEWARE OF LOW PRICE COMPETITORS CLAIMING TO BE 100% BAMBOO when they are in fact a polyester blend. ✔ COMPLETE 4-PIECE QUEEN BAMBOO BED SHEET SET - Includes 1 Flat sheet: 90X102'',1 Fitted sheet: 60X80'',2 envelope-style pillowcases: 20X30''. The pillowcases and flat sheet feature quality sewn double-stitched seams to ensure long-lasting durability and easy care with cold water washing, while offering a sensuous silky feel that grows luxuriously softer with every wash. ✔ ULTIMATE COOLING SOFTNESS and BREATHABLE COMFORT - Pure Bamboo fabric is naturally thermo-regulating to keep you cool and relaxed while sleeping and providing all season comfort. The moisture-wicking properties of Pure Bamboo resort-grade bedding is perfect for those of you with sensitive skin. Pure Bamboo Sheets are the ultimate in luxurious softness. ✔ DEEP FITTED POCKETS, SATEEN WEAVE - Pure Bamboo fitted sheets have a fully elasticized border to ensure a snug and reliable fit for any mattress up to 15 inches thick. All Pure Bamboo bedding is made from 100% Organic Bamboo sateen weave fabric for a softer, smoother and more silky feel than other fabric sheets. 100% Organic Bamboo is the optimal choice for durability and pilling resistance as higher thread counts mean thinner and weaker bamboo fibers ✔ ADJUST TEMPERATRUE & ABSORB WATER - Bamboo has the function of adjusting temperature and can absorb most of the heat in summer, so that you can still feel as cool as ice in hot summer. At the same time, bamboo can also absorb moisture, keep you cool and dry all night, and eliminate bad sleep experience, which is the gospel of the people with night sweats. ✔SUSTAINABLE & ECO-FRIENDLY - Every Pure Bamboo bedding purchase is backed by a risk-free against defects in materials and craftsmanship. Always cold water wash and use low heat drying to maintain optimal performance over time. Bamboo replenishes itself in as little as 3 years with minimal water or environmental impact. Sleep soundly on these soft as silk sheets, knowing that they are made from eco-friendly and responsibly sourced materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OXKclQ+lL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SGI bedding","source_asin":"B0B2PM9ZZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-958757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2PM9ZZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2PM9ZZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
